# Scratch scripts for local UI auditing (puppeteer screenshots, DOM probes).
tools-dev/

# The generated corpora are large and reproducible from the generator; the one
# exception is the pinned mainnet positive control, which is public chain data
# (address, shared r, txids) and is what the recovery test runs against.
!/data/control-252474.json

# Local UI audit output: full-page capture tiles and stitched screenshots.
# `**/` because these live under site/.impeccable as well as the repo root, and a
# pattern with a slash in it is anchored to the file it is written in.
**/.impeccable/review/
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/questions/
